    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660270/extras/6500a2506f8a8cb48e63d27f2dc61902.poster.avif?t=1625613207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660270/extras/6500a2506f8a8cb48e63d27f2dc61902.webm?t=1625613207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1660270/extras/6500a2506f8a8cb48e63d27f2dc61902.mp4?t=1625613207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Welcome to Mini Island!</strong><br><br>Rain Island: Orange is a one small hold &amp; Gun, boss Rush mini-game of Casual difficulty!<br>This beautiful place was built only for simple fun! Choose the character and difficulty level that best suits you and enjoy a short, simple but colorful boss rush minigame!<br><br><strong>More About &amp; Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Casual difficulty<br></li><li> Hold &amp; Gun and Boss Rush<br></li><li> Simple Hit &amp; Dodge Style Action.<br></li><li> 4 types of 16 playable characters.<br></li><li> 7 stages with 26 boss fights.<br></li><li> Colorful and sparkling art graphics.<br></li><li> 20 minutes to 35 minutes playtime</li></ul>",
